  "body": "To view the property documents copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/M15A\r\n\r\nSome homes just make family life easier, and this former show home is one of them. Spread across multiple levels with separate living zones, there's room to come together when you want to and plenty of space to escape when you don't.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen sits at the heart of the home, connecting naturally with the living areas and making everyday life and entertaining easy. Fresh neutral tones, excellent natural light and brand-new premium commercial-grade carpet give the home a crisp, modern feel throughout.\r\n\r\nWith four to five bedrooms and two bathrooms, there's genuine flexibility here for families of all shapes and stages. The primary suite is a standout, enjoying views towards Orewa and opening to its own private deck, while the different levels create great options for teenagers, guests, working from home or simply having your own space.\r\n\r\nOutside is where this home really comes into its own. North-facing outdoor living makes the most of the sun, while a private landscaped patio and spa pool set the scene for relaxed evenings and summer entertaining. The fully fenced backyard gives kids and pets room to play, and the large double garage with workshop is complemented by additional parking for the boat or campervan.\r\n\r\nBuilt in a combination of Linear weatherboard, plastered block and rendered brick, this is a substantial home that has been beautifully maintained and presented.\r\n\r\nThe location ties it all together. Surrounded by quality homes, you've got buses right outside, easy motorway access and Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants and shops just minutes away. The estuary walkway and local sports fields are also close by when it's time to get outdoors.\r\n\r\nThere's also the option to purchase the home furnished, adding another layer of flexibility for the next owners.",
